  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic elegance and cozy charm with our Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, this quilt set is perfect for adding warmth and a timeless touch to any bedroom. Personalize it with a name or choose to add pillowcases for a truly unique bedding experience.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Rustic farmhouse quilt with charming elephant patterns.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Option to add a custom name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), and King (102''x91'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for family and loved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes one quilt, with an option to add two pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried for simple maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), King (102''x91'')</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
